---
description: Commit message format. Use when generating or writing git commit message
alwaysApply: false
---

- Summary line starts with `##`
- Group changes by file path
- Write in bullet points rather than in paragraphs
- Use relative paths from project root

## Short imperative summary

path/to/file1
- Specific change in file 1

path/to/file2
- Specific change in file 2